<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS4" title="In Appendix C Experiment Details ‣ Appendix ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.4 </span>Remaining Results.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS5" title="In Appendix C Experiment Details ‣ Appendix ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.5 </span>A practical method for choosing the scaling coefficient</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Appendix ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>More Results and Disucssions for Section <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
