<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Performance of merging ViT-B-16 models across eight downstream vision tasks. The second section (from RegMean to ProDistill) include methods that use task-specific data, and the third section is data-free methods. “FDA (<span id="S4.T1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">init model</span>, <span id="S4.T1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">FDA init</span>)” denotes the choice of the initial model and the initialization strategies for FDAs, respectively. “<math id="S4.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>” denotes the performance improvement compared to the initial model.</figcaption>
</figure>
