<section id="Pt1" class="ltx_part">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_part"><span id="Pt1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center">Appendix</span>
<br class="ltx_break"></h2>

<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Derivation for equation <a href="#S2.E3" title="In 2.2 FDA Construction: Knowledge Projection via Gradient Matching ‣ 2 A Model Merging Framework with Functional Dual Anchors ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We first recall the settings. Given a linear encoder <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>φ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>, <em id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">i.e.</em>, <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{y}}={\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒚</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{y}}={\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{W}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d},{\bm{x}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{W}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d},{\bm{x}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, the corresponding pretrained parameter and the downstream parameter on the <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th task are denoted by <math id="A1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{W}}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{W}}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{W}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{W}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively. Assuming that <math id="A1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{Dist}({\bm{W}}_{0}{\bm{x}},{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}})=\frac{1}{2}\|{\bm{W}}_{0}{\bm{x}}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{Dist}({\bm{W}}_{0}{\bm{x}},{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}})=\frac{1}{2}\|{\bm{W}}_{0}{\bm{x}}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we derive the iteration formula via gradient descent.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">The objective function can be written as follows:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\min_{{\bm{x}}}\;\mathrm{cos\_dist}\!\left(\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}},\;{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>min</mi><mi>𝒙</mi></munder><mo lspace="0.447em">⁡</mo><mi>cos</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mpadded style="width:1.525em;" width="1.525em"><mi>dist</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></msub><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{{\bm{x}}}\;\mathrm{cos\_dist}\!\left(\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}},\;{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> be the step size and <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{0,1,2,\dots\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{0,1,2,\dots\}</annotation></semantics></math> the iteration index. The gradient-descent update is</span></p>
<table id="A1.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}-\eta\,\nabla_{{\bm{x}}_{t}}\,\mathrm{cos\_dist}\!\left(\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}},\;{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0.337em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mi>cos</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mpadded style="width:1.525em;" width="1.525em"><mi>dist</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></msub><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}-\eta\,\nabla_{{\bm{x}}_{t}}\,\mathrm{cos\_dist}\!\left(\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}},\;{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{cos\_dist}(A,B)=1-\frac{\langle A,B\rangle_{F}}{\|A\|_{F}\|B\|_{F}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>dist</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{cos\_dist}(A,B)=1-\frac{\langle A,B\rangle_{F}}{\|A\|_{F}\|B\|_{F}}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle A,B\rangle_{F}:=\mathrm{tr}(A^{\top}B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle A,B\rangle_{F}:=\mathrm{tr}(A^{\top}B)</annotation></semantics></math>, we rewrite equation <a href="#A1.E8" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix A Derivation for equation ‣ Appendix ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> as</span></p>
<table id="A1.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\,\Delta_{t},\qquad\Delta_{t}:=\nabla_{{\bm{x}}_{t}}\,\frac{\left\langle\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}},\;{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\right\rangle_{F}}{\left\|\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}}\right\|_{F}\;\|{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\|_{F}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.280em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\,\Delta_{t},\qquad\Delta_{t}:=\nabla_{{\bm{x}}_{t}}\,\frac{\left\langle\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}},\;{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\right\rangle_{F}}{\left\|\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}}\right\|_{F}\;\|{\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}\|_{F}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 1: Computing the <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{W}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{W}}</annotation></semantics></math>-gradient.<span id="A1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
For the <math id="A1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>-th row <math id="A1.p3.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\bm{W}}_{j,:}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{W}}_{j,:}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}_{j,:}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="1.200em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="1.200em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}_{j,:}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\big({\bm{W}}_{0}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big)_{j}\;{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\big({\bm{W}}_{0}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big)_{j}\;{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Stacking rows gives</span></p>
<table id="A1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}}=({\bm{W}}_{0}-{\bm{W}}_{i})\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}=-\,\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top},\qquad\Delta{\bm{W}}:={\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></msub><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left.\nabla_{{\bm{W}}}\tfrac{1}{2}\big\|{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}-{\bm{W}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{t}\big\|_{2}^{2}\right|_{{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{0}}=({\bm{W}}_{0}-{\bm{W}}_{i})\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}=-\,\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top},\qquad\Delta{\bm{W}}:={\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 2: Plugging equation <a href="#A1.E11" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix A Derivation for equation ‣ Appendix ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> into <math id="A1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.p4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
The numerator in equation <a href="#A1.E9" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix A Derivation for equation ‣ Appendix ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> becomes</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\langle-\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top},\;\Delta{\bm{W}}\right\rangle_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\langle-\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top},\;\Delta{\bm{W}}\right\rangle_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\,\mathrm{tr}\!\big({\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\big)=-\,{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}=-\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.670em;" width="0.670em"><mi>tr</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\,\mathrm{tr}\!\big({\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\big)=-\,{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}=-\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">The denominator equals</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|-\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}\right\|_{F}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}=\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|-\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}{\bm{x}}_{t}^{\top}\right\|_{F}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}=\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">Hence the scalar inside the gradient is</span></p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\,\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\,\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p4.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A1.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}=\nabla_{{\bm{x}}_{t}}\!\left(-\,\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}=\nabla_{{\bm{x}}_{t}}\!\left(-\,\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 3: Evaluating <math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> (assume <math id="A1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>W</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>).<span id="A1.p5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Using <math id="A1.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\bm{u}}\|A{\bm{u}}\|_{2}=\frac{A^{\top}A\,{\bm{u}}}{\|A{\bm{u}}\|_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\bm{u}}\|A{\bm{u}}\|_{2}=\frac{A^{\top}A\,{\bm{u}}}{\|A{\bm{u}}\|_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\bm{u}}\|{\bm{u}}\|_{2}=\frac{{\bm{u}}}{\|{\bm{u}}\|_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝒖</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>𝒖</mi><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝒖</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\bm{u}}\|{\bm{u}}\|_{2}=\frac{{\bm{u}}}{\|{\bm{u}}\|_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Delta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Delta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\frac{1}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}}\left[\frac{\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}-\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}^{3}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}\right]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\frac{1}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}}\left[\frac{\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}-\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}^{3}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 4: Iteration in affine form.<span id="A1.p6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Write</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{t}=\sigma_{t}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}+\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{t}=\sigma_{t}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}+\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">where</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{t}=\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}^{3}}\;&gt;\;0,\qquad\beta_{t}=-\,\frac{1}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}\;&lt;\;0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.558em">&gt;</mo><mn> 0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0.558em">&lt;</mo><mn> 0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{t}=\frac{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}^{3}}\;&gt;\;0,\qquad\beta_{t}=-\,\frac{1}{\|\Delta{\bm{W}}\|_{F}\,\|\Delta{\bm{W}}{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}\,\|{\bm{x}}_{t}\|_{2}}\;&lt;\;0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text">Hence</span></p>
<table id="A1.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\Delta_{t}=(1+\eta\sigma_{t})\,{\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\Delta_{t}=(1+\eta\sigma_{t})\,{\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text">Note that <math id="A1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta\sigma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta\sigma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> generally is a small positive number. Thus, for better analysis, we approximate the iteration as</span></p>
<table id="A1.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\Delta_{t}=\,{\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.448em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\Delta_{t}=\,{\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p6.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.5.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Proof for Proposition <a href="#S2.Thmtheorem1" title="Proposition 2.1. ‣ 2.2 FDA Construction: Knowledge Projection via Gradient Matching ‣ 2 A Model Merging Framework with Functional Dual Anchors ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Proposition <a href="#S2.Thmtheorem1" title="Proposition 2.1. ‣ 2.2 FDA Construction: Knowledge Projection via Gradient Matching ‣ 2 A Model Merging Framework with Functional Dual Anchors ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.1</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">We start from the iteration in equation <a href="#S2.E3" title="In 2.2 FDA Construction: Knowledge Projection via Gradient Matching ‣ 2 A Model Merging Framework with Functional Dual Anchors ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>:</span></p>
<table id="A2.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t},\quad\Delta{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0},\quad t=0,\dots,T-1." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>η</mi><mi>β</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>𝑾</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>𝒙</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\,\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t},\quad\Delta{\bm{W}}={\bm{W}}_{i}-{\bm{W}}_{0},\quad t=0,\dots,T-1.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">And we have that:
<math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}={\bm{U}}\bm{\Lambda}{\bm{U}}^{\top}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚲</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑼</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}={\bm{U}}\bm{\Lambda}{\bm{U}}^{\top},</annotation></semantics></math>
where <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{U}}=[{\bm{u}}_{1},\dots,{\bm{u}}_{d}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{U}}=[{\bm{u}}_{1},\dots,{\bm{u}}_{d}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}</annotation></semantics></math> is orthogonal and <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\Lambda}=\mathrm{diag}(\lambda_{1},\dots,\lambda_{d})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝚲</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\Lambda}=\mathrm{diag}(\lambda_{1},\dots,\lambda_{d})</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{1}&gt;\cdots&gt;\lambda_{d}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">&gt;</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.1389em">⋯</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em">&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{1}&gt;\cdots&gt;\lambda_{d}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 1: Project <math id="A2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> onto the eigenbasis.<span id="A2.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Let</span></span></p>
<table id="A2.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\,{\bm{u}}_{i}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\,{\bm{u}}_{i},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{t}^{i}={\bm{u}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{x}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{t}^{i}={\bm{u}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{x}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then</span></p>
<table id="A2.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}=\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\,{\bm{u}}_{i}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\,\lambda_{i}\,{\bm{u}}_{i}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\,{\bm{x}}_{t}=\Delta{\bm{W}}^{\top}\Delta{\bm{W}}\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\,{\bm{u}}_{i}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\,\lambda_{i}\,{\bm{u}}_{i}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 2: Plugging the projection into equation <a href="#S2.E3" title="In 2.2 FDA Construction: Knowledge Projection via Gradient Matching ‣ 2 A Model Merging Framework with Functional Dual Anchors ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.<span id="A2.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></p>
<table id="A2.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\lambda_{i}{\bm{u}}_{i}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}{\bm{u}}_{i}+\sum_{i=1}^{d}(\eta\beta_{t}\lambda_{i}c_{t}^{i}){\bm{u}}_{i}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}(1+\eta\beta_{t}\lambda_{i}){\bm{u}}_{i}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒖</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}_{t+1}={\bm{x}}_{t}+\eta\beta_{t}\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}\lambda_{i}{\bm{u}}_{i}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}{\bm{u}}_{i}+\sum_{i=1}^{d}(\eta\beta_{t}\lambda_{i}c_{t}^{i}){\bm{u}}_{i}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}c_{t}^{i}(1+\eta\beta_{t}\lambda_{i}){\bm{u}}_{i}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Define <math id="A2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{t}=-\eta\beta_{t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{t}=-\eta\beta_{t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, then
<math id="A2.p4.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="c_{t+1}^{i}=c_{t}^{i}(1-\gamma_{t}\lambda_{i}),\quad t=0,\dots,T-1." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{t+1}^{i}=c_{t}^{i}(1-\gamma_{t}\lambda_{i}),\quad t=0,\dots,T-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 3: Recursion.<span id="A2.p5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
By recursion, we can get the formula in proposition <a href="#S2.Thmtheorem1" title="Proposition 2.1. ‣ 2.2 FDA Construction: Knowledge Projection via Gradient Matching ‣ 2 A Model Merging Framework with Functional Dual Anchors ‣ Model Merging with Functional Dual Anchors" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.1</span></a>:</span></span></p>
<table id="A2.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="c_{t}^{i}=c_{0}^{i}\prod_{j=0}^{t-1}(1-\gamma_{j}\lambda_{i}),\quad i=1,\dots,d." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{t}^{i}=c_{0}^{i}\prod_{j=0}^{t-1}(1-\gamma_{j}\lambda_{i}),\quad i=1,\dots,d.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Experiment Details</h3>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Details of downstream models for Merging</h4>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">vision</span> task, we follow the setup in previous works <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ilharco et al., 2022</a>; <a href="#bib.bib61" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yadav et al., 2023</a>)</cite>. Specifically, we adopt eight public, domain-specific foundation models from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ilharco et al. (2022)</a></cite>, which obtained by finetuning the pretrained Vision Encoder of CLIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib42" title="" class="ltx_ref">Radford et al., 2021</a>)</cite> on the following datasets: SUN397 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib58" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xiao et al., 2016</a>)</cite>, Cars <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">Krause et al., 2013</a>)</cite>, RESISC45 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cheng et al., 2017</a>)</cite>, EuroSAT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib24" title="" class="ltx_ref">Helber et al., 2019</a>)</cite>, SVHN <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib39" title="" class="ltx_ref">Netzer et al., 2011</a>)</cite>, GTSRB <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib48" title="" class="ltx_ref">Stallkamp et al., 2011</a>)</cite>, MNIST <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">LeCun et al., 1998</a>)</cite> and DTD <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cimpoi et al., 2014</a>)</cite>.
All sizes of these models, i.e., ViT-B/32, ViT-B/16 and ViT-L/14, are taken into consideration.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For natural language processing task, we also follow previous works <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yu et al., 2024</a>; <a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xu et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. Specifically, we consider the downstream models of eight datasets from the GLUE benchmark <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib51" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2018a</a>)</cite>, including CoLA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib54" title="" class="ltx_ref">Warstadt et al., 2018</a>)</cite>, SST-2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">Socher et al., 2013</a>)</cite>, MRPC <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Dolan &amp; Brockett, 2005</a>)</cite>, STS-B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cer et al., 2017</a>)</cite>, QQP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Iyer et al., 2017</a>)</cite>, MNLI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib57" title="" class="ltx_ref">Williams et al., 2017</a>)</cite>, QNLI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib51" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2018a</a>; <a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rajpurkar et al., 2016</a>)</cite>, RTE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib51" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2018a</a>; <a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Haim et al., 2006</a>; <a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Giampiccolo et al., 2007</a>; <a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bentivogli et al., 2009</a>)</cite>. To obtain the downstream models, we follow the finetuning procedure of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yu et al. (2024)</a></cite> on publicly available pretrained RoBERTa-Base and RoBERTa-Large.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For auto-regressive models, we follow the practice in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yu et al. (2024)</a></cite> and consider two expert models: the Math expert model WizardMath-13B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">Luo et al., 2023</a>)</cite> and the Code expert model LLaMA-2-13B-Code-Alpaca.
We use four datasets for evaluation, including GSM8K <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cobbe et al., 2021</a>)</cite>, MATH <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hendrycks et al., 2020</a>)</cite>, HumanEval <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2021</a>)</cite> and MBPP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Austin et al., 2021</a>)</cite>. For evaluation, we adopt the evaluation codes of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xu et al. (2025)</a></cite>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Details of Baseline methods</h4>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For data-based baselines (<em id="A3.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">i.e.</em>, RegMean <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jin et al., 2022</a>)</cite>, Fisher merging <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">Matena &amp; Raffel, 2022</a>)</cite>, AdaMerging <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib62" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al., 2023</a>)</cite>, and ProDistill <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xu et al., 2025</a>)</cite>), we follow the released implementations. For ViT, we adopt the results reported in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xu et al. (2025)</a></cite> as they rely on the same public checkpoints. For LLM, we simply set the coefficient of TA method as <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.5</annotation></semantics></math>, which is adopted in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xu et al. (2025)</a></cite>. For data-free baseline methods (<em id="A3.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">i.e.</em>, TA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ilharco et al., 2022</a>)</cite>, TSV <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Gargiulo et al., 2025</a>)</cite>, and WUDI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cheng et al., 2025</a>)</cite>), we use their publicly available open-source code. We try our best to ensure fair and strong baselines.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Details of FDAs</h4>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All FDAs in our experiments follows the layer-wise manner. We keep the settings of the construction and adaptation consistent across layers. Both Gaussian and parameter initializations are considered. For Gaussian initialization, we set <math id="A3.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma=0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma=0.01</annotation></semantics></math>. Both initializations share the same settings.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FDA Construction.</span> For ViT and RoBERTa, we first set the number <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> of anchors as <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>64</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">64</annotation></semantics></math> for each task. Then, the <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{token\_num}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>token</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>num</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{token\_num}</annotation></semantics></math> of FDAs for ViT follows the default settings: <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>50</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50</annotation></semantics></math> for ViT-B/32, <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="197" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>197</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">197</annotation></semantics></math> for ViT-B/16, and <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="257" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>257</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">257</annotation></semantics></math> for ViT-L/14. For RoBERTa-Base and RoBERTa-Large, we fix the <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{token\_num}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>token</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>num</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{token\_num}</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math>. To optimize these anchors, we adopt the AdamW optimizer <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">Loshchilov &amp; Hutter, 2017</a>)</cite>, iterating for <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1200" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1200</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1200</annotation></semantics></math> steps with a learning rate of <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1e-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1e-2</annotation></semantics></math>. For WizardMATH and llama-2-13b-alpaca, we construct FDAs for feed-forword networks. Thus, we only set the number <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> of anchors as <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8192" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>8192</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8192</annotation></semantics></math>. We also adopt AdamW optimizer, iterating for <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="200" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>200</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">200</annotation></semantics></math> steps with a learning rate of <math id="A3.SS3.p2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1e-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1e-2</annotation></semantics></math>. All the above optimizations are performed with a full batch size.</p>
</div>
