<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Performance of merging ViT-B/32 models across eight downstream vision tasks. “FDA (<span id="A3.T5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">init model</span>, <span id="A3.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">FDA init</span>)” denotes the choice of the initial model and the initialization strategies for FDAs, respectively. “Pretrained” denotes the initial model is the pretrained model.</figcaption>
